# This file allows us to add out of band annotations of the auto-generated plptools Swift APIs. Right now, it exists
# solely to ensure the RFSV class remains available to the Swift API even though it is not copyable or movable. We
# achieve this by the dangerous act of making it an immortal reference. This means it should _never_ be used directly as
# references are guaranteed to leak. Fortunately Reconnect only uses `RFSVClient` which manages `RFSV` internally.
---
Name: core
Tags:
- Name: RFSV
  SwiftImportAs: reference
  SwiftRetainOp: immortal
  SwiftReleaseOp: immortal
